msgid ""
"===============\n"
"Product XML IDs\n"
"===============\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:f1b6d2688ac6edeff91eab5938f7f4c68d415f8aee1965c8ee0a8980c28512de\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-LGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-GetFluvo%2Faddons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/tree/20.0/product_template_xmlid\n"
"    :alt: GetFluvo/addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This module gives every product created in the interface, or imported\n"
"without an XML ID, a predictable XML ID, so that it can be referenced in\n"
"imports and integrations without looking up its database id.\n"
"\n"
"When a product is created, the module adds an XML ID\n"
"``product_template.<name>``, where ``<name>`` is made from:\n"
"\n"
"- the internal reference of the product, for example ``FURN-0001``\n"
"  becomes ``product_template.furn_0001``;\n"
"- or, for products without an internal reference, its English name, for\n"
"  example *Desk Organizer (Large)* becomes\n"
"  ``product_template.desk_organizer_large``.\n"
"\n"
"The name is lowercased, accents are removed, and every other character\n"
"than a letter or a digit is replaced by ``_``.\n"
"\n"
"No XML ID is generated for products that already have one, such as\n"
"products imported with an *ID* column or loaded from data files, or when\n"
"the name is already used by another product; the latter is logged as a\n"
"warning.\n"
"\n"
"Together with ``product_template_attribute_value_xmlid``, the attribute\n"
"values of these products get an XML ID too.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"Products created in the interface get no XML ID. Imports and\n"
"integrations then have to reference them by database id, which differs\n"
"between databases, or by name, which is not unique.\n"
"\n"
"``product_template_attribute_value_xmlid`` only names the attribute\n"
"values of products that have an XML ID, so the variants of these\n"
"products could not be referenced either.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"XML IDs are generated automatically when a product is created.\n"
"\n"
"To generate the XML IDs of products that existed before the module was\n"
"installed:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Products > Products* and switch to the list view.\n"
"2. Select the products.\n"
"3. Click *Actions > Generate XML IDs*.\n"
"\n"
"Products that already have an XML ID are left as they are. Odoo shows\n"
"how many of the selected products got one.\n"
"\n"
"The XML ID is made once, at creation: it does not change when the\n"
"internal reference or the name of the product changes later.\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"- Product variants (``product.product``) get no XML ID of their own.\n"
"- Products whose name or internal reference consists of characters\n"
"  without an ASCII equivalent only, for example in Chinese, get no XML\n"
"  ID.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/issues/new?body=module:%20product_template_xmlid%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
